# usage-tracker — provider API keys
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copied to ~/.config/usage-tracker/env by ./install.sh (or the setup wizard).
# Loaded by BOTH ./start.sh and the systemd user service, so keys work whether
# you run the server by hand or on login.
#
# Format: KEY=value  — no quotes, no `export`, one per line (systemd-compatible).
# Uncomment only the providers you use. A missing key simply hides that card
# ("no dead cards") — nothing breaks.
#
# Claude Code, Codex and local runners (Ollama/LM Studio/Jan) need NO keys —
# they read your local files. Keys below are only for the hosted providers.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ── Real $ spend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...          # https://openrouter.ai/keys  (spend + credit + limit)
# OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY=sk-admin-...         # OpenAI Costs API needs an ADMIN key; a project key returns 401
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...               # candidate — balance endpoint documented, not yet live-verified

# ── Credit balance (candidate — verify with your own key) ───────────────────
# TOGETHER_API_KEY=...                  # https://api.together.xyz/settings/api-keys
# NOVITA_API_KEY=...                    # https://novita.ai/settings/key-management
# DEEPINFRA_API_KEY=...                 # or DEEPINFRA_TOKEN

# ── Quota ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=...                # character quota + monthly reset
# HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=hf_...            # or HF_TOKEN

# ── Local runners: URL overrides only (no key needed) ───────────────────────
# LMSTUDIO_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1234
# JAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1337
